---
// EngineCards — generated by generate_translated_components.py
---

<section class="py-16 lg:py-24 bg-[#080810]">
  <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-6 lg:px-20">
    <div class="mb-12">
      <div class="font-mono text-accent text-xs font-semibold tracking-[0.2em] mb-4">// 내장 엔진</div>
      <h2 class="text-white text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold mb-4">4개 소프트웨어 엔진. 640+ 검증된 명령어.</h2>
      <p class="text-[#9CA3AF] text-base max-w-2xl mb-6">AgentPuter의 모든 기능은 실제 소프트웨어 엔진으로 구동 — GUI 스크린샷이 아닌 CLI로 제어.</p>
      <div class="flex gap-6 text-xs text-[#4B5563] font-mono">
        <span><span class="text-accent">640+</span> 검증된 명령어 시퀀스</span>
        <span><span class="text-accent">4</span> 핵심 시나리오 커버 엔진</span>
        <span><span class="text-accent">100%</span> 로컬 처리</span>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-2 gap-6">
        <div class="bg-[#0D0D1A] rounded-2xl p-6 md:p-7 border transition-all duration-200 hover:-translate-y-0.5" style="border-color: rgba(56,189,248,0.2);">
          <div class="flex items-start justify-between mb-4">
            <div class="flex items-center gap-3">
              <span class="text-3xl">📄</span>
              <div>
                <div class="flex items-center gap-2">
                  <span class="font-bold font-mono text-base" style="color: #38BDF8;">ap-docs</span>
                  <span class="text-xs font-bold font-mono px-2 py-0.5 rounded" style="color: #38BDF8; background: rgba(56,189,248,0.08);">158 ✓</span>
                </div>
                <p class="text-[#4A4A6A] text-xs mt-0.5">LibreOffice</p>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
          <p class="text-xs font-mono mb-3" style="color: #38BDF8; opacity: 0.7;">Writer · Calc · Impress · Draw — 헤드리스 모드</p>
          <p class="text-[#6B7280] text-xs leading-relaxed mb-5">LibreOffice 제품군 완전 헤드리스 제어. 매크로, 템플릿, 차트로 Word/Excel/PPT/PDF 생성.</p>
          <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-2 mb-5">
            <span class="text-xs px-2.5 py-1 rounded font-mono" style="background: rgba(56,189,248,0.08); color: #38BDF8;">Writer 문서</span>
              <span class="text-xs px-2.5 py-1 rounded font-mono" style="background: rgba(56,189,248,0.08); color: #38BDF8;">Calc 스프레드시트</span>
              <span class="text-xs px-2.5 py-1 rounded font-mono" style="background: rgba(56,189,248,0.08); color: #38BDF8;">Impress 프레젠테이션</span>
              <span class="text-xs px-2.5 py-1 rounded font-mono" style="background: rgba(56,189,248,0.08); color: #38BDF8;">Draw 그래픽</span>
              <span class="text-xs px-2.5 py-1 rounded font-mono" style="background: rgba(56,189,248,0.08); color: #38BDF8;">PDF 내보내기</span>
              <span class="text-xs px-2.5 py-1 rounded font-mono" style="background: rgba(56,189,248,0.08); color: #38BDF8;">템플릿 적용</span>
          </div>
          <div class="bg-black/40 rounded-xl p-4 space-y-1.5 mb-5 font-mono">
            <p class="text-xs"><span class="text-[#2A2A3A]">$ </span><span class="text-[#94A3B8]">ap-docs new --type report</span></p>
            <p class="text-xs"><span class="text-[#2A2A3A]">$ </span><span class="text-[#94A3B8]">ap-docs chart --data file.csv</span></p>
            <p class="text-xs"><span class="text-[#2A2A3A]">$ </span><span class="text-[#94A3B8]">ap-docs export --pdf --toc</span></p>
            <p class="text-xs"><span class="text-[#2A2A3A]">$ </span><span class="text-[#94A3B8]">ap-docs macro run --name monthly</span></p>
          </div>
          <div class="flex flex-wrap items-center justify-between gap-2">
            <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-2">
              <span class="text-xs text-[#4B5563] border border-[#1E1E2E] px-2 py-0.5 rounded font-mono">분기별 보고서</span>
              <span class="text-xs text-[#4B5563] border border-[#1E1E2E] px-2 py-0.5 rounded font-mono">기술 문서</span>
              <span class="text-xs text-[#4B5563] border border-[#1E1E2E] px-2 py-0.5 rounded font-mono">계약서 작성</span>
            </div>
            <a href="/features" class="text-xs font-mono transition-colors" style="color: #38BDF8;">사용 사례 보기 →</a>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="bg-[#0D0D1A] rounded-2xl p-6 md:p-7 border transition-all duration-200 hover:-translate-y-0.5" style="border-color: rgba(167,139,250,0.2);">
          <div class="flex items-start justify-between mb-4">
            <div class="flex items-center gap-3">
              <span class="text-3xl">🎨</span>
              <div>
                <div class="flex items-center gap-2">
                  <span class="font-bold font-mono text-base" style="color: #A78BFA;">ap-design</span>
                  <span class="text-xs font-bold font-mono px-2 py-0.5 rounded" style="color: #A78BFA; background: rgba(167,139,250,0.08);">203 ✓</span>
                </div>
                <p class="text-[#4A4A6A] text-xs mt-0.5">Inkscape</p>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
          <p class="text-xs font-mono mb-3" style="color: #A78BFA; opacity: 0.7;">SVG 벡터 · 포스터 · 아이콘 · 로고 · 픽셀 내보내기</p>
          <p class="text-[#6B7280] text-xs leading-relaxed mb-5">Inkscape를 통한 SVG 노드, 경로, 필터, 텍스트 레이아웃 정밀 CLI 제어. 임의 해상도로 내보내기.</p>
          <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-2 mb-5">
            <span class="text-xs px-2.5 py-1 rounded font-mono" style="background: rgba(167,139,250,0.08); color: #A78BFA;">SVG 벡터 아트</span>
              <span class="text-xs px-2.5 py-1 rounded font-mono" style="background: rgba(167,139,250,0.08); color: #A78BFA;">포스터 디자인</span>
              <span class="text-xs px-2.5 py-1 rounded font-mono" style="background: rgba(167,139,250,0.08); color: #A78BFA;">아이콘 생성</span>
              <span class="text-xs px-2.5 py-1 rounded font-mono" style="background: rgba(167,139,250,0.08); color: #A78BFA;">경로 연산</span>
              <span class="text-xs px-2.5 py-1 rounded font-mono" style="background: rgba(167,139,250,0.08); color: #A78BFA;">필터 효과</span>
              <span class="text-xs px-2.5 py-1 rounded font-mono" style="background: rgba(167,139,250,0.08); color: #A78BFA;">일괄 내보내기</span>
          </div>
          <div class="bg-black/40 rounded-xl p-4 space-y-1.5 mb-5 font-mono">
            <p class="text-xs"><span class="text-[#2A2A3A]">$ </span><span class="text-[#94A3B8]">ap-design canvas --size 1080x1920</span></p>
            <p class="text-xs"><span class="text-[#2A2A3A]">$ </span><span class="text-[#94A3B8]">ap-design text --weight bold --color white</span></p>
            <p class="text-xs"><span class="text-[#2A2A3A]">$ </span><span class="text-[#94A3B8]">ap-design export --png 2x</span></p>
            <p class="text-xs"><span class="text-[#2A2A3A]">$ </span><span class="text-[#94A3B8]">ap-design batch --variants 10</span></p>
          </div>
          <div class="flex flex-wrap items-center justify-between gap-2">
            <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-2">
              <span class="text-xs text-[#4B5563] border border-[#1E1E2E] px-2 py-0.5 rounded font-mono">마케팅 포스터</span>
              <span class="text-xs text-[#4B5563] border border-[#1E1E2E] px-2 py-0.5 rounded font-mono">브랜드 자산</span>
              <span class="text-xs text-[#4B5563] border border-[#1E1E2E] px-2 py-0.5 rounded font-mono">UI 아이콘</span>
            </div>
            <a href="/features" class="text-xs font-mono transition-colors" style="color: #A78BFA;">사용 사례 보기 →</a>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="bg-[#0D0D1A] rounded-2xl p-6 md:p-7 border transition-all duration-200 hover:-translate-y-0.5" style="border-color: rgba(251,191,36,0.2);">
          <div class="flex items-start justify-between mb-4">
            <div class="flex items-center gap-3">
              <span class="text-3xl">📐</span>
              <div>
                <div class="flex items-center gap-2">
                  <span class="font-bold font-mono text-base" style="color: #FBBF24;">ap-diagrams</span>
                  <span class="text-xs font-bold font-mono px-2 py-0.5 rounded" style="color: #FBBF24; background: rgba(251,191,36,0.08);">138 ✓</span>
                </div>
                <p class="text-[#4A4A6A] text-xs mt-0.5">Draw.io (diagrams.net)</p>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
          <p class="text-xs font-mono mb-3" style="color: #FBBF24; opacity: 0.7;">순서도 · 아키텍처 · ER · 시퀀스 · UML</p>
          <p class="text-[#6B7280] text-xs leading-relaxed mb-5">draw.io CLI를 통해 전문 기술 다이어그램을 프로그래밍 방식으로 생성. AWS/GCP/Azure 아이콘 라이브러리 내장.</p>
          <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-2 mb-5">
            <span class="text-xs px-2.5 py-1 rounded font-mono" style="background: rgba(251,191,36,0.08); color: #FBBF24;">마이크로서비스 아키텍처</span>
              <span class="text-xs px-2.5 py-1 rounded font-mono" style="background: rgba(251,191,36,0.08); color: #FBBF24;">네트워크 토폴로지</span>
              <span class="text-xs px-2.5 py-1 rounded font-mono" style="background: rgba(251,191,36,0.08); color: #FBBF24;">ER 데이터베이스 다이어그램</span>
              <span class="text-xs px-2.5 py-1 rounded font-mono" style="background: rgba(251,191,36,0.08); color: #FBBF24;">비즈니스 플로우</span>
              <span class="text-xs px-2.5 py-1 rounded font-mono" style="background: rgba(251,191,36,0.08); color: #FBBF24;">시퀀스 다이어그램</span>
              <span class="text-xs px-2.5 py-1 rounded font-mono" style="background: rgba(251,191,36,0.08); color: #FBBF24;">UML 클래스 다이어그램</span>
          </div>
          <div class="bg-black/40 rounded-xl p-4 space-y-1.5 mb-5 font-mono">
            <p class="text-xs"><span class="text-[#2A2A3A]">$ </span><span class="text-[#94A3B8]">ap-diagrams new --type microservice</span></p>
            <p class="text-xs"><span class="text-[#2A2A3A]">$ </span><span class="text-[#94A3B8]">ap-diagrams add node --label 'API Gateway'</span></p>
            <p class="text-xs"><span class="text-[#2A2A3A]">$ </span><span class="text-[#94A3B8]">ap-diagrams export --svg --theme dark</span></p>
            <p class="text-xs"><span class="text-[#2A2A3A]">$ </span><span class="text-[#94A3B8]">ap-diagrams from-schema --input db.sql</span></p>
          </div>
          <div class="flex flex-wrap items-center justify-between gap-2">
            <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-2">
              <span class="text-xs text-[#4B5563] border border-[#1E1E2E] px-2 py-0.5 rounded font-mono">시스템 아키텍처</span>
              <span class="text-xs text-[#4B5563] border border-[#1E1E2E] px-2 py-0.5 rounded font-mono">DB 설계</span>
              <span class="text-xs text-[#4B5563] border border-[#1E1E2E] px-2 py-0.5 rounded font-mono">비즈니스 프로세스</span>
            </div>
            <a href="/features" class="text-xs font-mono transition-colors" style="color: #FBBF24;">사용 사례 보기 →</a>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="bg-[#0D0D1A] rounded-2xl p-6 md:p-7 border transition-all duration-200 hover:-translate-y-0.5" style="border-color: rgba(74,222,128,0.2);">
          <div class="flex items-start justify-between mb-4">
            <div class="flex items-center gap-3">
              <span class="text-3xl">🎵</span>
              <div>
                <div class="flex items-center gap-2">
                  <span class="font-bold font-mono text-base" style="color: #4ADE80;">ap-audio</span>
                  <span class="text-xs font-bold font-mono px-2 py-0.5 rounded" style="color: #4ADE80; background: rgba(74,222,128,0.08);">141 ✓</span>
                </div>
                <p class="text-[#4A4A6A] text-xs mt-0.5">sox + ffmpeg</p>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
          <p class="text-xs font-mono mb-3" style="color: #4ADE80; opacity: 0.7;">노이즈 제거 · 편집 · 변환 · 라우드니스 정규화</p>
          <p class="text-[#6B7280] text-xs leading-relaxed mb-5">sox가 오디오 효과와 분석을 처리; ffmpeg가 코덱 및 컨테이너 변환을 관리. 배치 처리 지원.</p>
          <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-2 mb-5">
            <span class="text-xs px-2.5 py-1 rounded font-mono" style="background: rgba(74,222,128,0.08); color: #4ADE80;">스마트 노이즈 제거</span>
              <span class="text-xs px-2.5 py-1 rounded font-mono" style="background: rgba(74,222,128,0.08); color: #4ADE80;">무음 감지 & 트림</span>
              <span class="text-xs px-2.5 py-1 rounded font-mono" style="background: rgba(74,222,128,0.08); color: #4ADE80;">EBU R128 라우드니스 정규화</span>
              <span class="text-xs px-2.5 py-1 rounded font-mono" style="background: rgba(74,222,128,0.08); color: #4ADE80;">포맷 변환</span>
              <span class="text-xs px-2.5 py-1 rounded font-mono" style="background: rgba(74,222,128,0.08); color: #4ADE80;">멀티트랙 믹스</span>
              <span class="text-xs px-2.5 py-1 rounded font-mono" style="background: rgba(74,222,128,0.08); color: #4ADE80;">오디오 분석</span>
          </div>
          <div class="bg-black/40 rounded-xl p-4 space-y-1.5 mb-5 font-mono">
            <p class="text-xs"><span class="text-[#2A2A3A]">$ </span><span class="text-[#94A3B8]">ap-audio denoise --input raw.wav</span></p>
            <p class="text-xs"><span class="text-[#2A2A3A]">$ </span><span class="text-[#94A3B8]">ap-audio loudnorm --target -14 LUFS</span></p>
            <p class="text-xs"><span class="text-[#2A2A3A]">$ </span><span class="text-[#94A3B8]">ap-audio convert --mp3 128k</span></p>
            <p class="text-xs"><span class="text-[#2A2A3A]">$ </span><span class="text-[#94A3B8]">ap-audio trim --remove-silence</span></p>
          </div>
          <div class="flex flex-wrap items-center justify-between gap-2">
            <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-2">
              <span class="text-xs text-[#4B5563] border border-[#1E1E2E] px-2 py-0.5 rounded font-mono">팟캐스트 후처리</span>
              <span class="text-xs text-[#4B5563] border border-[#1E1E2E] px-2 py-0.5 rounded font-mono">강의 녹음</span>
              <span class="text-xs text-[#4B5563] border border-[#1E1E2E] px-2 py-0.5 rounded font-mono">회의 오디오</span>
            </div>
            <a href="/features" class="text-xs font-mono transition-colors" style="color: #4ADE80;">사용 사례 보기 →</a>
          </div>
        </div>
    </div>
    <div class="mt-12 pt-8 border-t border-[#1E1E2E]">
      <p class="font-mono text-xs text-accent font-bold tracking-widest mb-3">// GUI가 아닌 CLI를 사용하는 이유</p>
      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-5 text-xs text-[#4B5563] leading-relaxed">
        <div><p class="text-[#94A3B8] font-semibold mb-1">안정적인 API</p>CLI 인터페이스는 UI 업데이트로 인해 중단되지 않습니다. 한 번의 통합으로 장기간 사용 가능.</div>
        <div><p class="text-[#94A3B8] font-semibold mb-1">정밀한 제어</p>파일, 좌표, 파라미터를 직접 조작 — 매번 픽셀 단위로 정확한 출력.</div>
        <div><p class="text-[#94A3B8] font-semibold mb-1">일괄 처리 가능</p>동일한 명령어로 100개 이상의 작업을 동시에 실행. GUI 자동화는 한 번에 하나의 작업만 가능.</div>
      </div>
      <p class="text-[#2A2A3A] text-xs font-mono mt-4">// Based on CLI-Anything by HKUDS Lab (MIT License) · Extended &amp; internalized by AgentPuter</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
